    <div class="eyebrow">National agricultural distribution</div>
    <h1>Egg farmers and business buyers in KwaZulu-Natal</h1>
    <p>FarmLink Distribution connects approved egg farmers and agricultural suppliers with retailers, wholesalers, bakeries, restaurants, caterers and institutions across KwaZulu-Natal.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="https://www.farmlinkdistribution.co.za/#portal">Register or place an order</a><a class="btn secondary" href="tel:+27774573727">Call +27 77 457 3727</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Province coverage</div>
    <h2>Structured supply and buyer coordination across KwaZulu-Natal</h2>
    <p class="lead">FarmLink reviews commercial requirements, supplier capacity, product specifications, packaging, delivery area and payment terms before confirming a transaction.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card"><h3>For egg farmers</h3><p>Submit farm capacity, egg sizes, packaging formats, weekly availability and collection location for commercial review.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>For business buyers</h3><p>Request bulk supply for retail, hospitality, catering, food manufacturing, schools and other institutions.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>For logistics coordination</h3><p>Collection and delivery arrangements are agreed according to route, volume, vehicle requirements and timing.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Areas served</div>
    <h2>FarmLink coverage in KwaZulu-Natal</h2>
    <p class="lead">FarmLink supports enquiries across Durban, Pietermaritzburg, Richards Bay, Newcastle and surrounding agricultural districts. Availability depends on approved suppliers and confirmed routes.</p>
