    <h2>Buying and supplying through FarmLink</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>How do I find egg farmers in KwaZulu-Natal?</summary><p>Register your buying requirement with FarmLink. The team reviews your location, volume and delivery requirements before matching the enquiry with suitable approved suppliers.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can farmers in KwaZulu-Natal register?</summary><p>Yes. Egg farmers and agricultural suppliers can submit capacity, location, packaging and commercial details for review.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does FarmLink coordinate delivery?</summary><p>Delivery and collection requirements are confirmed per quotation based on route, order volume, timing and available logistics capacity.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

